# {{ name }}

Leptos fullstack app (SSR + hydration) on {{ backend.backend }}, generated by
[rise](https://github.com/EryyynIT/rise).

Stack: leptos + {{ backend.backend }} + {{ backend.database }}{% if backend.database in ['sqlite', 'sled'] %} (embedded — no database server){% endif %}{% if 'auth' in backend.features %} + JWT auth{% endif %}.

## Prerequisites

```sh
rustup target add wasm32-unknown-unknown
cargo install --locked cargo-leptos
```

`rise doctor` checks these for you.
{%- if 'grpc' in backend.features %}
The gRPC service (port 50051) builds with protoc —
https://grpc.io/docs/protoc-installation/
{%- endif %}

## Run

```sh
{%- if backend.database not in ['sqlite', 'sled'] or 'auth' in backend.features %}
cp .env.example .env  # {% if backend.database not in ['sqlite', 'sled'] %}set DATABASE_URL{% if 'auth' in backend.features %} and JWT_SECRET{% endif %}{% else %}set JWT_SECRET{% endif %}
{%- endif %}
cargo leptos watch
```

The app listens on http://localhost:3000 (SSR + hydration). The database is
wired into the `database_status` server function.
{%- if 'web-sockets' in backend.features %}
`/ws` is a WebSocket echo endpoint.
{%- endif %}
{%- if 'graph-ql' in backend.features %}
`/graphql` answers GraphQL queries (POST) and serves GraphiQL (GET).
{%- endif %}
{%- if 'grpc' in backend.features %}
The gRPC Greeter service listens on :50051.
{%- endif %}
{%- if 'auth' in backend.features %}
`POST /auth/register` + `POST /auth/login` issue JWTs; `/api/me` takes one
as `Authorization: Bearer <token>`.
{%- endif %}

## Test

```sh
cargo test --features ssr
```
